(
    title: "Basketball",
    developer: Some("Alan Miller"),
    description: Some("Atari\'s one-on-one basketball, written by Alan Miller. You and an opponent — a second player or the console — each control a single figure; whoever is on offence dribbles automatically and always faces the basket, while the defender tries to steal the ball or block the shot. Score and the roles flip: the scorer inbounds on defence. A match runs four minutes and the higher score wins."),
